  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "After Chu Du asks Fang Yuan to join the search for the secret of eternal life and Limitless Demon Venerable’s later-year achievement, Not Immortal’s will proposes that after the Hei Fan battle Fang Yuan go to Crazed Demon Cave so they can set the Crazed Demon Agreement. Fang Yuan agrees.",
      "chapters": [
        1176
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_chu_du",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_limitless_demon_venerable",
        "char_not_immortal",
        "char_hei_fan",
        "loc_crazed_demon_cave"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Pang Shan tells Fang Yuan they will talk in depth after the Crazed Demon Agreement, and that establishing it requires going down to the third last layer, which Pang Shan will not join because he cannot move easily. Not Immortal leads Fang Yuan and Chu Du there. Fang Yuan judges that a poor showing exploring the dao mark landscape might mean they refuse to set the agreement with him at all.",
      "chapters": [
        1188
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "third-last-layer",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_pang_shan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After the third last layer probe, Not Immortal wants to set the alliance agreement before talking further. Fang Yuan later tells Not Immortal he came to sign the Crazed Demon Agreement and that it is done. Having undergone it, his relationship with Chu Du deepens again.",
      "chapters": [
        1189
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "signed-and-binding",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "After the Crazed Demon Agreement, Chu Du treats Fang Yuan as an equal and their relationship becomes much closer.",
      "chapters": [
        1202
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "closer-cooperation",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "When Chu Du publicly expels Liu Guan Yi from Chu Sect, his letter Gu still hopes for future cooperation. Both immortal tribulation tempering aperture and the Crazed Demon Agreement give Chu Du reason to keep working with Fang Yuan in secret.",
      "chapters": [
        1210
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "secret-cooperation-basis",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_chu_sect"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan underwent the Crazed Demon Agreement using Liu Guan Yi’s identity and became a member of Crazed Demon Cave like Chu Du. By a later return he has already gotten rid of its restrictions, and the Three Crazed Demon Eccentrics have the killer move do not care that can completely ignore the agreement.",
      "chapters": [
        1863
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "restrictions-shed",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_three_crazed_demon_eccentrics"
      ]
    }
  ],
